OL,3,AAI staff 'genuinely frightened' for
OL,4,Ahumanity's future, ex-Anthropic
OL,5,Aresearcher tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn AI researcher who quit Anthropic
OL,8,Ftold the BBC that people working on the
OL,9,Ftechnology are "genuinely frightened"
OL,10,Fabout the speed of its advancements and
OL,11,Fwhat it could mean for humanity.
OL,13,FJacob Coxon spoke with BBC's Laura
OL,14,FKuenssberg on Saturday about his viral
OL,15,Fresignation post where he raised
OL,16,Fconcerns about out-of-control
OL,17,Fartificial intelligence.
OL,19,F"I believe that if we don't slow down
OL,20,Fat the current rate of progress, there
OL,21,Fis a strong chance that we could all
OL,22,Fdie in the immediate future," he said.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
