OL,3,AStudent loan terms to be made clearer
OL,4,Ain England
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquiry found the way loans had
OL,7,Fbeen presented to teenagers amounted to
OL,8,Fmis-selling, after the BBC revealed the
OL,9,FDepartment for Education (DfE) had
OL,10,Fcompared repayments to #30-a-month
OL,11,Fphone contracts.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
