OL,3,ASaudi Arabia shuts key oil pipeline
OL,4,Aafter drone attack launched from Iraq
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaudi Arabia has closed a critical oil
OL,7,Fpipeline after it was attacked by
OL,8,Fdrones launched from Iraq, as conflict
OL,9,Fin the Middle East widens.
OL,11,FIraq said it had fired a military
OL,12,Fcommander and launched an investigation
OL,13,Fafter admitting the drone attack on its
OL,14,Fneighbour's East-West pipeline had
OL,15,Foriginated in one of its provinces
OL,16,Fbordering Iran. Saudi Arabia has
OL,17,Fpreviously accused Iran-backed militia
OL,18,Fin Iraq of targeting its oil
OL,19,Ffacilities.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
